{"data":{"description":"The CCTV Camera gives realtime security views around your base once it's powered and paired with a Computer Station, and it needs 3 rW. You can't craft one, so loot Locked Crates (1-2), [Satellite Crates](/world/satellite-crate) (2-4) or Bradley Crates, all above 40%. It's used in 4 recipes, such as the [Auto Turret](/items/auto-turret) and Drone, and recycling any of those 4 in a Green Recycler gives a 50% chance at a camera. The [Livestock Vendor](/world/livestock-vendor) can also pay with one.","item":{"id":"cctv-camera","name":"CCTV Camera","path":"/v1/items/cctv-camera.json","slug":"cctv-camera"},"name":"CCTV Camera","path":"/v1/recycler/cctv-camera.json","recyclers":[{"guaranteed":[{"amount":2,"item":{"id":"techparts","name":"Tech Trash","path":"/v1/items/tech-trash.json","slug":"tech-trash"}},{"amount":2,"item":{"id":"metal-refined","name":"High Quality Metal","path":"/v1/items/high-quality-metal.json","slug":"high-quality-metal"}}],"percentage":[{"amount":25,"item":{"id":"techparts","name":"Tech Trash","path":"/v1/items/tech-trash.json","slug":"tech-trash"}},{"amount":25,"item":{"id":"metal-refined","name":"High Quality Metal","path":"/v1/items/high-quality-metal.json","slug":"high-quality-metal"}}],"recycler":{"id":"recycler-red","name":"Red Recycler","path":"/v1/world/recycler-red.json","slug":"recycler-red"}},{"guaranteed":[{"amount":1,"item":{"id":"techparts","name":"Tech Trash","path":"/v1/items/tech-trash.json","slug":"tech-trash"}},{"amount":1,"item":{"id":"metal-refined","name":"High Quality Metal","path":"/v1/items/high-quality-metal.json","slug":"high-quality-metal"}}],"percentage":[{"amount":20,"item":{"id":"techparts","name":"Tech Trash","path":"/v1/items/tech-trash.json","slug":"tech-trash"}},{"amount":20,"item":{"id":"metal-refined","name":"High Quality Metal","path":"/v1/items/high-quality-metal.json","slug":"high-quality-metal"}}],"recycler":{"id":"recycler-yellow","name":"Yellow Recycler","path":"/v1/world/recycler-ye